# Mouse-over help on every field and control (hard rule)

Operator directive (Phil, 2026-08): **every field and control in the
admin SPA must have mouse-over help.**

## The rule

> **Every interactive field and control in the AIC Server admin SPA
> (`pim-offline-server/ui`) must expose mouse-over help that explains
> what the control does — via MUI `Tooltip`, registered `fieldHelper` /
> `FieldHelpIcon` / `ControlHelp` / `Helped*` wrappers, or
> `data-help-key` backed by [`ui/src/help/fieldHelp.ts`](../../pim-offline-server/ui/src/help/fieldHelp.ts).
> Native HTML `title` alone is insufficient for icon-only actions when
> a Tooltip is available. Section 508: help must also be reachable via
> keyboard focus (`Tab`) and `aria-label` / `aria-describedby` where
> appropriate. Truncation tooltips that only repeat the cell value do
> **not** count as field help.**

## Applies to

| Control class | Help required |
| --- | --- |
| Text inputs | `TextField`, `Select`, `Autocomplete`, `Checkbox`, `Switch`, `Radio`, `Slider` |
| Actions | `Button`, `IconButton`, clickable `Chip`, DataGrid action cells |
| Headers | DataGrid column headers that are interactive (sort/filter menus) |

## Does not apply to

- Pure static typography / decorative icons with no operator action
- Truncation-only value tooltips (still required for overflow per
  [`essential-ui-actions-must-be-visible.mdc`](essential-ui-actions-must-be-visible.mdc);
  add separate purpose help when the control is interactive)

## Required patterns

1. Prefer a **registry key** in `FIELD_HELP` / `CONTROL_HELP` and
   `HelpedTextField` / `HelpedIconButton` / `ControlHelp`.
2. `helperText={fieldHelper('key')}` or `Tooltip title={…}` with the
   purpose text; set `data-help-key="key"` for audit.
3. Icon-only buttons: always wrap with `Tooltip` (or `HelpedIconButton`)
   plus `aria-label` matching the help summary.
4. Help copy: short (1–2 sentences), US English, no unexplained jargon.

## Forbidden

- Shipping a new `TextField` / `IconButton` / primary action without
  purpose help.
- Treating truncated-value `Tooltip title={cellValue}` as compliance
  with this rule.
- Claiming suite-wide coverage while `scripts/audit-control-help.mjs`
  reports gaps on in-scope paths.

## Enforcement

- Static: `pim-offline-server/ui/scripts/audit-control-help.mjs` —
  `npm run audit:control-help` (and `prebuild` / `lint`) run with
  `--deny` and fail on bare controls. Warn-only:
  `npm run audit:control-help:warn`. Allowlist:
  `ui/docs/control-help-allowlist.md` (must stay empty unless justified).
- Live: Playwright hover spot checks under `ui/e2e/*control-help*`.
- Agent: when adding or editing admin SPA controls, land help in the
  same change set.

